# Master's Guide-Mural // Master's Manufactory. Turn 1: the Mural enters (cast with Black Lotus for {W}{W}{W}, Mox Sapphire and Mox
# Ruby) and makes a 4/4 white and blue Golem artifact creature token. Turn 5: Craft with artifact {4}{W}{W}{U} (five Moxen and two
# Plains), exiling the Golem token as the material (a token is an artifact Bot1 controls); the Mural returns transformed as Master's
# Manufactory, white and blue by its color indicator. It entered this turn, so its {T} ability may be activated at once and makes
# another Golem; once tapped it cannot be used again. Turn 7: no artifact has entered yet, so it cannot be activated; after Bot1 casts
# an Ornithopter (another artifact entering under its control) it can, and makes a second Golem.

